  "solution": "**Concept Used:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/fc9e33ac43019f25bfa3fc3159fa6b2e9efb3ede9eb676ddbd5bc4d465256026.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ 2-[2 (1)/(2) times(-(2)/(3))-5left{(1)/(5)-((3)/(5)-(7)/(10))right}]\n\n⇒ 2-[2 (1)/(2) times(-(2)/(3))-5left{(1)/(5)+(1)/(10)right}] \n\n⇒ 2-[2 (1)/(2) times(-(2)/(3))-5times(3)/(10)] \n\n⇒ 2-[ (5)/(2) times-(2)/(3)-5times(3)/(10)]\n\n⇒ 2-[ -(10)/(6)-(15)/(10)]\n\n⇒ 2 + (190)/(60)\n\n⇒ 310/60\n\n⇒ **5large{(1)/(6)}**\n\n**∴ The correct answer is **5large{(1)/(6)}",
